// Title: Potential DLL Sideloading Via VMware Xfer
// Rule ID: 9313dc13-d04c-46d8-af4a-a930cc55d93b
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1574.001
// Category: image_load
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
